    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <a href="" class="text-[10px] text-gray uppercase">home</a>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray"> > </span>
        <a href="" class="text-[10px] text-gray uppercase">product</a><span
          class="text-[10px] text-gray"
        >
          >
        </span>
        <a href="" class="text-[10px] text-gray uppercase">watch</a>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex justify-between items-start w-full border-b pb-5 border-gray/20"
      >
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
            <p class="text-[20px]">Classic Product</p>
            <p class="text-[14px]">£209.00 – £249.00</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <span class="flex pt-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-orange-400 text-[11px]"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-orange-400 text-[11px]"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-orange-400 text-[11px]"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-orange-400 text-[11px]"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-orange-400 text-[11px]"></i></span
          >
          <p class="text-[11px]">
            SKU: <span class="text-gray">492260</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex border-b pb-5 border-gray/20">
        <p class="text-[14px] text-gray">
          Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting
          industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the standard dummy text. Lorem Ipsum is
          simply dummy text of the printing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-b pb-5 border-gray/20">
        <div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
            <h4 class="uppercase text-[11px]">Color</h4>
            <button
              class="block w-[31px] h-[20px] bg-black border border-black/80 cursor-pointer"
